# MoonPay

> Official website and developer integration resources for MoonPay.

Use this website to research MoonPay products. Request the homepage with Accept: text/markdown for a text representation. Use the platform API documentation when building an integration; use the official CLI documentation for terminal or MCP workflows. Follow the linked authentication and approval requirements before acting on a user's behalf. This website does not expose an unauthenticated transaction API.

## Developer resources

- [Platform OpenAPI schema](https://api.moonpay.com/platform/openapi.json): Canonical machine-readable API operations, servers and authentication requirements.
- [Developer documentation](https://dev.moonpay.com/): Integration setup and authentication guidance.
- [Developer documentation index](https://dev.moonpay.com/llms.txt): Agent-readable documentation discovery.

## CLI and agent tools

- [Official CLI package](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@moonpay/cli): Published @moonpay/cli package; executable names mp and moonpay.
- [Official MoonPay CLI and skills](https://github.com/moonpay/skills): Installation with npm install -g @moonpay/cli; the mp mcp command starts the documented MCP interface. Review current setup and authentication instructions here before use.
- [MoonPay agents](https://www.moonpay.com/agents): Supported agent products and capabilities.
